>  - Fold test for Address size fault into helper, reuse existing
>    definitions
>  - Get rid of 'magic' shift for transforming FIPA field to an actual IPA
>  - Add BUG_ON() to handle_host_mem_abort() if we fail to resolve the
>    fault IPA.
> 
